  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/15/custom-background-hd.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"78\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">概述</span></p><p>本資源包專為我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>模組包設計，現獨立發布。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">功能說明</span></p><p>此資源包能讓您自由更換主選單背景，提升原版遊戲體驗。&nbsp;</p><p>只需下載並套用此資源包，即可享受自訂主選單背景。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>更換背景步驟：</p><p>- 取得任意PNG截圖或高清圖片，覆蓋壓縮檔內以下路徑檔案：<em>Custom Background HD.zip / assets / minecraft / textures / gui / title / background /&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">panorama_overlay.png</span></em></p><p>- 確認背景圖片已更名為'panorama_overlay.png'&nbsp;</p><p>- 套用資源包後即可使用自訂主選單背景</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>預設背景來源 -&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fillustrations%252ffire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/illustrations/fire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583/</a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/12/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/13/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/14/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器與好友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，使用優惠碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
